    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-238-241">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-241-256"><rb>母</rb><rt>かあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-256-259">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-259-274"><rb>足</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-274-277">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-277-292"><rb>痛</rb><rt>いた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-292-300">い。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-300-321"><rb>我慢</rb><rt>がまん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-321-338">をしろよ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-338-341">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-341-356"><rb>母</rb><rt>かあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-356-365">、もう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-365-380"><rb>歩</rb><rt>ある</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-380-394">けない。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-394-412">もう、すこし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412-433"><rb>我慢</rb><rt>がまん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-433-450">をしろよ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-450-453">お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-453-468"><rb>母</rb><rt>かあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-468-500">、どこへいくのだい？</seg></p>
      <p>「…………」</p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-520-535"><rb>空</rb><rt>そら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-535-538">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-538-550"><rb>真</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-550-553">っ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-553-568"><rb>暗</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-568-582">である。</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-582-597"><rb>怖</rb><rt>おそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-597-606">ろしい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-606-621"><rb>波</rb><rt>なみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-621-624">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-624-642"><rb>轟</rb><rt>とどろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-642-648">きが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-648-660"><rb>聞</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-660-672">こえる。</seg></p>
    </body>
